@FullRes.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Health check
GET {{FullRes.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Reverse image search (multipart/form-data)
# Replace ./sample.jpg with a real JPG/PNG/WEBP file (max 20 MB).
POST {{FullRes.Api_HostAddress}}/api/images/search
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FullResBoundary

------FullResBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="sample.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./sample.jpg
------FullResBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="sortBy"

resolution
------FullResBoundary--

###
